### Try the API from VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (click "Send Request").
@api = http://localhost:8000

### Status: AI engine and documents
GET {{api}}/health

### Upload a document (returns immediately; it's read in the background)
POST {{api}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="my_document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./path/to/my_document.pdf
--b--

### List documents and their status (processing / ready / failed)
GET {{api}}/documents

### Ask a question
POST {{api}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "What is the notice period?"}

### Ask about one document only (use a doc_id from the list above)
POST {{api}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "What is the notice period?", "doc_ids": ["paste-doc-id-here"]}

### A follow-up question (earlier turns are sent as history)
POST {{api}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "Does that change during probation?", "history": [{"question": "What is the notice period?", "answer": "The notice period is 30 days."}]}

### Summary of the whole document, streamed as it is written (one JSON event per line)
POST {{api}}/query/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"question": "Summarize the key points of this document"}
